  "description_short": "Laid-back tavern in Thembalethu serving good value drinks and eats in a friendly local atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Blue House Tavern is a well-established local spot in Thembalethu, George, where the community gathers for cold drinks and hearty meals. The atmosphere is relaxed and welcoming, with a loyal crowd of regulars who appreciate the honest prices and friendly service.\n\nThe tavern serves up classic pub fare alongside local favourites, keeping things simple and satisfying. It's the kind of place where you can settle in for a few drinks with friends, catch up on sports, and enjoy the genuine warmth of a neighbourhood tavern. Located on Tabata Street, Blue House Tavern offers an authentic slice of Thembalethu's social scene, making it a solid choice for those looking to experience George beyond the tourist trail.",
